CLI Host
===============================================================================

The CLI host exposes arguments, environment, a standard-input snapshot and output streams as contexts.

1. Contexts
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

```text
cli/env
cli/args
cli/stdin
cli/stdout
cli/stderr
```

`cli/env`, `cli/args` and `cli/stdin` support reads. `cli/stdout` and `cli/stderr` support writes/sends.

